Clang rejects pr85331's __builtin_shuffle as unknown, rather than executing
the program. That control is NOT RUN, not PASS; integer shuffle's explicit
profile admission does not certify floating shuffle execution. This case
stays separately unresolved, not included in the four agreed FP deferrals.

The inline-vector and unsigned scalar-broadcast repairs have separate RED,
two-interpreter value checks and default/-O3 original native replays in
language-semantics.out and vector-scalar-conversions.out.
